Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.65,0:00:02.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Sam Altman says
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.10,0:00:03.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}everything will get cheap.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.10,0:00:04.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Housing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.85,0:00:05.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Education.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.69,0:00:06.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Food.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.42,0:00:07.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Clothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.24,0:00:08.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Everything necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.90,0:00:09.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}His reason:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.93,0:00:11.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}artificial intelligence
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.07,0:00:12.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and robots will do the work.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.03,0:00:14.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Your receipts say the opposite.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.01,0:00:16.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Rent, up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.29,0:00:17.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Groceries, up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.80,0:00:19.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The power bill, up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.50,0:00:20.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And your paycheck has
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.52,0:00:21.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}to cover all of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.50,0:00:24.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Yet he could still be right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.50,0:00:26.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Prices don't fall all at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.52,0:00:28.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}They fall one after another.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.45,0:00:30.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So what gets cheap first,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.31,0:00:30.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and which of your
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.03,0:00:32.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}bills never will?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.66,0:00:33.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The first price
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.41,0:00:34.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}has already fallen.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.72,0:00:35.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Almost to nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.56,0:00:38.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Up to a week of a top programmer's
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.42,0:00:39.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}work can now cost
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.68,0:00:40.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}less than a dollar.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.41,0:00:42.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But one thing on his
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.23,0:00:44.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}list may never get cheap.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.20,0:00:45.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}It may even rise.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.83,0:00:47.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So he may be half right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.08,0:00:48.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And your paycheck
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.96,0:00:50.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}depends on which half.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.77,0:00:53.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}This January, he made
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.63,0:00:54.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the promise again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.98,0:00:58.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}It looks like on the whole,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.14,0:01:00.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}given certainly progress
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.14,0:01:00.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}with work you can do
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.02,0:01:01.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}in front of a computer,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.74,0:01:02.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}but also what looks like
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.70,0:01:04.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}it will soon happen with robotics
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.46,0:01:07.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and a bunch of other things,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.18,0:01:07.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}we're going to have
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.74,0:01:10.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}massively deflationary pressure
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.96,0:01:12.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Deflationary pressure.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.89,0:01:14.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}In plain words:
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.11,0:01:15.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}prices heading down.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.13,0:01:17.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}His argument is stronger
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.58,0:01:18.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}than it sounds:
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.87,0:01:20.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}almost every price you pay
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.67,0:01:22.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}is mostly other people's time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.11,0:01:24.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Of every dollar
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.06,0:01:25.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Americans spend on food,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.80,0:01:26.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}more than half pays
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.01,0:01:28.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}for somebody's work.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.55,0:01:30.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The farm gets about 12 cents.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.09,0:01:32.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Let superintelligence do
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.57,0:01:33.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the thinking and
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.43,0:01:34.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}robots the lifting,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.93,0:01:36.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and the price sinks toward
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.29,0:01:37.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}what the machines cost.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.04,0:01:39.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}He even pictures a house,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.75,0:01:40.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}built by robots,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.84,0:01:41.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}for about the cost
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.77,0:01:42.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}of renting them.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.43,0:01:44.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Then again, he runs
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.75,0:01:47.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the company behind ChatGPT.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.30,0:01:48.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Cheap intelligence is
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.54,0:01:49.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}what he sells.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.92,0:01:51.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But his claim can be tested.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.03,0:01:53.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Six price tags,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.49,0:01:55.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}from pure thought to solid ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.02,0:01:57.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Then a seventh,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.04,0:01:58.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}with your name on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.50,0:02:00.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And for each, one question:
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.87,0:02:03.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}how much of this price is work?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.28,0:02:05.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Start where a price
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.47,0:02:07.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}is nothing but work.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.17,0:02:08.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Not lifting.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.39,0:02:09.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.28,0:02:10.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Knowledge and advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.29,0:02:12.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}That programmer's week for less
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.83,0:02:13.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}than a dollar
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.55,0:02:15.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}is Altman's own example.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.60,0:02:16.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And by his count,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.62,0:02:18.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}AI gets about 10 times
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.32,0:02:19.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}cheaper every year.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.09,0:02:20.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Across Europe,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.86,0:02:22.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}about 3 in 10 literary
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.65,0:02:23.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}translators say it has
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.96,0:02:25.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}already cost them work.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.91,0:02:27.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But a falling cost is not
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.42,0:02:29.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}yet a falling price.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.38,0:02:31.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Law firms have AI too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.29,0:02:32.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Yet the vast majority
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.66,0:02:33.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}of legal fees
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.42,0:02:34.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}in America are still
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.62,0:02:35.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}billed by the hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.09,0:02:36.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Many firms even
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.94,0:02:38.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}raised their rates.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.88,0:02:40.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So that's what gets cheap
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.31,0:02:42.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}first: pure thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.78,0:02:43.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But only as fast
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.86,0:02:45.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}as competition forces it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.85,0:02:47.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Which explains a strange case:
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.10,0:02:50.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}something became nearly free,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.16,0:02:52.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and its price kept climbing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.12,0:02:54.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Education.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.27,0:02:55.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}It's on his list.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.63,0:02:56.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}In some studies,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.68,0:02:58.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}students with a well-built
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.06,0:02:59.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}AI tutor learn more
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.46,0:03:00.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}than they do in class.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.81,0:03:01.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And the tutor
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.33,0:03:02.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}costs almost nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.83,0:03:03.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So a degree should
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.67,0:03:04.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}be getting cheaper.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.11,0:03:06.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Its price tag isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.07,0:03:08.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}This fall, the sticker
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.20,0:03:09.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}price at America's
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.21,0:03:11.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}public universities went up again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.56,0:03:13.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Because a big part of that price
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.09,0:03:14.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}was never the knowledge.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.56,0:03:15.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}It's the certificate.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.90,0:03:17.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And only the university
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.28,0:03:18.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}can print it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.33,0:03:20.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So the second tag splits in two.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.79,0:03:22.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The knowledge is nearly free.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.68,0:03:24.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The diploma is not.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.47,0:03:26.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}This channel exists
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.54,0:03:27.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}for one reason:
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.00,0:03:28.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}so that the arrival
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.91,0:03:30.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}of superintelligence
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.04,0:03:31.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}goes well for everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.94,0:03:32.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Including the people
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.88,0:03:34.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}whose work it makes cheap.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.57,0:03:35.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Want that too?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.69,0:03:36.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Then subscribe.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.87,0:03:39.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So far, every price
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.51,0:03:41.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}was made of information.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.17,0:03:41.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}What about things you
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.95,0:03:43.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}can drop on your foot?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.66,0:03:46.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Elon Musk promises even more.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.44,0:03:47.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Asked this summer
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.31,0:03:48.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}whether some things
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.19,0:03:49.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}should simply be free
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.33,0:03:51.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}for everyone, he said:
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.77,0:03:54.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}As you heard me say,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.29,0:03:55.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}I don't think money's going
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.05,0:03:57.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}to matter in the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.25,0:03:58.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Anyone will be able to have
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.81,0:03:59.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}any goods and services
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.69,0:04:00.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}that they want.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.46,0:04:03.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Any goods, for anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.68,0:04:05.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So look at the goods.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.55,0:04:07.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The robots are real:
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.35,0:04:09.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}more than 5 million work in
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.18,0:04:10.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the world's factories.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.70,0:04:12.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And by the official numbers,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.24,0:04:13.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}adjusted for quality,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.80,0:04:15.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}American smartphone prices
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.51,0:04:17.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}fell by half in 5 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.99,0:04:18.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But this year,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.68,0:04:20.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}analysts expect phones
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.43,0:04:21.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}to cost more again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.16,0:04:24.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}AI data centers are buying up
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.10,0:04:25.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the memory chips your
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.12,0:04:26.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}next phone needs.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.66,0:04:28.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So the third tag does fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.12,0:04:30.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Slowly, and not
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.40,0:04:31.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}in a straight line.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.10,0:04:32.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Because a thing
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.98,0:04:34.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}is never only work.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.81,0:04:36.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}It's also materials,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.24,0:04:37.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}chips and power.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.96,0:04:40.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And power sits under every tag.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.83,0:04:42.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.22,0:04:44.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Altman says where
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.22,0:04:45.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the falling stops:
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.01,0:04:46.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}once machines build
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.98,0:04:48.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the data centers,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.17,0:04:49.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}intelligence should cost little
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.69,0:04:51.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}more than its electricity.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.52,0:04:53.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}That makes energy the floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.71,0:04:55.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And the floor isn't falling.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.73,0:04:57.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}In 5 years, American energy
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.51,0:04:59.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}prices rose by about a third.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.95,0:05:01.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Unless AI can lower
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.33,0:05:02.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the floor itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.04,0:05:04.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Demis Hassabis, the Nobel
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.74,0:05:06.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}laureate who runs Google DeepMind,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.84,0:05:07.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}thinks it could help
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.58,0:05:09.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}crack clean energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.32,0:05:09.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}He has a name
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.01,0:05:11.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}for the world after that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.80,0:05:13.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}…but it will at least remove
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.56,0:05:14.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}one of the big vectors,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.92,0:05:18.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}which is scarcity of resources,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.12,0:05:19.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}including land and more materials
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.72,0:05:22.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.28,0:05:23.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}I sometimes call it,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.24,0:05:23.100,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and others call it,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.04,0:05:25.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}this kind of radical abundance
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.98,0:05:27.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Radical abundance.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.93,0:05:29.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}It's a forecast,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.10,0:05:29.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}from a man whose
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.01,0:05:31.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}company builds AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.89,0:05:33.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But if it comes true,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.34,0:05:35.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}every other tag falls further.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.82,0:05:38.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}For now, the fourth tag stays up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.54,0:05:42.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}One tag needs energy, machines,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.17,0:05:44.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and something no factory can make.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.54,0:05:45.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Food.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.45,0:05:46.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Remember the food dollar:
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.99,0:05:48.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}more than half is work.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.79,0:05:49.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Machines can take
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.53,0:05:50.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}much of that out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.66,0:05:51.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But the ground under
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.53,0:05:53.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the food just set a record.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.45,0:05:54.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}American cropland has
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.70,0:05:55.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}never cost more.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.13,0:05:57.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So the fifth tag can fall
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.58,0:05:58.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}only part of the way:
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.91,0:06:00.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the work comes out of the price,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.77,0:06:02.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the ground stays in.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.39,0:06:03.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Which leaves the tag
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.26,0:06:04.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}with the most ground in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.98,0:06:06.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Housing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.16,0:06:09.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The first word on his list.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.32,0:06:11.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Go back to his robot-built house.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.67,0:06:12.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Listen to how
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.28,0:06:13.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}that sentence begins:
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.95,0:06:15.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}if robots can build a house
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.48,0:06:17.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}on land you already own.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.50,0:06:19.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Even in his own picture,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.07,0:06:20.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the land is already paid for.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.02,0:06:21.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And in America,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.03,0:06:23.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}about 40 cents of every
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.62,0:06:24.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}dollar a home is worth
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.98,0:06:26.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}isn't the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.09,0:06:27.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}It's the ground under it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.73,0:06:29.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Robots can make walls cheap.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.58,0:06:31.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}They can't make more ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.44,0:06:32.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Altman never hid this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.93,0:06:33.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}He wrote it himself:
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.21,0:06:35.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the price of limited resources
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.86,0:06:37.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}like land may rise
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.29,0:06:38.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}even more dramatically.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.39,0:06:41.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So the sixth tag stays hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.15,0:06:43.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}It may even rise.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.80,0:06:45.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}That makes Altman half right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.81,0:06:46.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Machines can take
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.95,0:06:48.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the work out of a price.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.53,0:06:50.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}They can't take out what's scarce.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.94,0:06:52.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And he knows which half is which.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.10,0:06:55.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So what does that do
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.54,0:06:56.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}to your money?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.85,0:06:58.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}This isn't financial advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.91,0:07:00.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}It's the seventh price tag.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.58,0:07:02.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The one with your name on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.27,0:07:03.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Run the same test.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.62,0:07:05.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}How much of this price is work?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.63,0:07:06.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}All of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.43,0:07:07.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}It's your wage.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.61,0:07:08.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Think back to the first
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.78,0:07:09.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}price that fell:
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.88,0:07:11.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}a programmer's week,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.10,0:07:12.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}for less than a dollar.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.68,0:07:14.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}That wasn't only a bargain.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.19,0:07:15.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}It was a paycheck.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.60,0:07:16.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}By his own argument,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.93,0:07:17.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}things get cheap
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.84,0:07:19.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}because work gets cheap.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.67,0:07:21.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And work is what most of us sell.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.36,0:07:23.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}This summer,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.31,0:07:24.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}American businesses produced
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.87,0:07:26.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}more with almost
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.16,0:07:27.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the same hours of work.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.12,0:07:29.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And the share of that income
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.36,0:07:30.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}going to workers
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.38,0:07:31.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}fell to the lowest
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.55,0:07:32.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}level on record.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.99,0:07:35.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}That's no proof AI did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.23,0:07:36.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But recently,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.23,0:07:37.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the Nobel-winning economist
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.71,0:07:39.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Daron Acemoglu pointed
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.40,0:07:41.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}to exactly this number.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.22,0:07:45.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}One telltale sign of automation
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.94,0:07:48.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}is that labor's share
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.70,0:07:50.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}of value added in industry,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.78,0:07:52.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}or labor's share
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.50,0:07:53.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}in national income,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.46,0:07:54.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}is going down.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.16,0:07:56.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Altman saw it too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.79,0:07:58.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}His promise has a second part.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.01,0:08:00.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}In full:
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.18,0:08:01.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}everything necessary
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.25,0:08:02.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}will be cheap,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.31,0:08:03.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and everyone will have enough
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.82,0:08:05.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}money to be able to afford it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.01,0:08:08.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And if the rules don't adapt?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.30,0:08:10.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}In the same essay, he wrote:
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.31,0:08:12.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}most people will end up worse
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.15,0:08:13.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}off than they are today.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.01,0:08:15.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Even for him,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.18,0:08:16.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}cheap was never enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.01,0:08:19.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So how does everyone
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.51,0:08:20.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}get enough money?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.95,0:08:22.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Three answers are on the table.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.75,0:08:24.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Each has a real weakness.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.83,0:08:26.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The first is the market:
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.51,0:08:27.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}let prices fall,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.67,0:08:29.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and every dollar buys more.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.65,0:08:30.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}It worked for your phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.23,0:08:33.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Its weakness is the seventh tag:
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.40,0:08:34.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}wages can fall right
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.65,0:08:35.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}along with prices.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.17,0:08:37.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The second is a fund:
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.91,0:08:39.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}everyone owns a share.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.52,0:08:40.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}That was Altman's plan,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.81,0:08:43.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}paid for by exactly two things:
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.21,0:08:45.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}big companies, and land.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.71,0:08:47.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Alaska already pays its people
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.72,0:08:48.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}a yearly check
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.64,0:08:49.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}from its oil wealth:
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.16,0:08:51.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}$1,200 this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.36,0:08:53.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}His plan imagined more
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.73,0:08:55.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}than 10 times that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.77,0:08:57.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Its weakness: a fund pays
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.91,0:08:59.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}what politics allows.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.65,0:09:01.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Alaska's lawmakers now
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.17,0:09:02.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}set the amount every year.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.25,0:09:04.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The third is a check:
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.04,0:09:06.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the government sends
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.09,0:09:07.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}everyone money.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.32,0:09:09.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Altman backed a test of it:
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.27,0:09:11.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}$1,000 a month, for 3 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.04,0:09:13.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}People bought basics,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.34,0:09:14.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and worked a little less.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.23,0:09:16.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Its weakness is the bill.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.14,0:09:18.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Even Altman has changed his
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.70,0:09:20.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}own answer more than once.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.70,0:09:23.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So that's the order.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.65,0:09:25.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Thinking falls first.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.63,0:09:27.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Things follow, slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.92,0:09:29.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Energy holds, for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.22,0:09:31.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The ground stays hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.17,0:09:33.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}He's half right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.44,0:09:35.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And that half is worth a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.05,0:09:37.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}What's still open
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.05,0:09:38.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}is the seventh tag.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.86,0:09:40.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Prices follow the machines.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.90,0:09:42.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Incomes follow the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.89,0:09:43.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And the rules are written
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.02,0:09:45.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}by people you elect.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.11,0:09:47.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Your wage is a price too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.17,0:09:49.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And cheap only makes
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.30,0:09:50.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}you richer if your
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.24,0:09:51.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}wage isn't the first
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.79,0:09:52.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}price to fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.92,0:09:54.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}This channel exists
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.97,0:09:56.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}for one reason:
